CM_ BO_ 4096 "Telem Leader Node. GPS moved to HighNoon/GPS.dbc (Photon gps_car / staging 0x10C0/0x10C1).";
CM_ "Merged from Photon UIPPlotsStaging HighNoon.dbc DAQ + telem_rev1 Suspension_Specials; IMU scales/temps from latest HighNoon telemetry. Server/DAqCAN IDs are telem-bus StdId + 0x1000 (extended). WheelRPM_FR/FL set to FSGP last-day (2026-07-23) wire = VCAT-WheelsBoard-Software WheelsCodek DLC8: ts u16 BE (bytes 0-1) + rpm u16 BE (bytes 2-3), bytes 4-7 unused; older FixedWheelsCode DLC6 rpm-u32 frames are intentionally not matched. WheelRPM_Back 0x14C0 = bus 0x4C0, DLC4 ts u16 BE + rpm u16 BE. NOTE: on 2026-07-23 the FR/FL hall payload is a free-running counter (rpm sensor likely disconnected) so RPM decodes cleanly but is not physical.";
CM_ BO_ 5280 "Wheel RPM front-right. Telem bus StdId 0x4A0 (FixedWheelsCode hallID) -> server 0x14A0.";
CM_ BO_ 5312 "Wheel RPM back/rear. Telem bus StdId 0x4C0 -> server 0x14C0. Not in Photon daq.dbc; present on FSGP wire.";
CM_ BO_ 5328 "Wheel RPM front-left. Telem bus StdId 0x4D0 (WheelsCodek CAN_ID_HALL) -> server 0x14D0.";


